<%# 에디토리얼 글 카드 — 카테고리 색 슬라이드 커버 + 모노 메타 %>
<% slug = post.category&.slug.to_s %>
<% variant = { "blog" => "dark", "tutorial" => "green", "qna" => "burgundy", "free-board" => "orange", "portfolio" => "gold", "notice" => "cream" }[slug] || %w[dark green burgundy orange].fetch(post.id % 4) %>
<%= link_to url_for_post(post), class: "tv-card tv-reveal" do %>
  <div class="tv-cover tv-cover--<%= variant %>" style="--p:<%= 22 + (post.id % 5) * 16 %>%">
    <% if post.pinned? %><span class="tv-lock">📌 고정</span><% end %>
    <div class="tv-cover-top">
      <span>TeoVibe</span>
      <span class="tv-cover-no"><%= post.category_name %></span>
    </div>
    <div class="tv-cover-mid">
      <span class="tv-cover-title"><%= post.title %></span>
    </div>
    <div class="tv-cover-bottom">
      <span class="tv-cover-tag"><%= post.user.nickname %></span>
      <span class="tv-cover-note"><%= time_ago_in_words(post.created_at) %> 전</span>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="tv-card-body">
    <p class="tv-card-desc"><%= post.body&.to_plain_text&.truncate(110) %></p>
    <div class="tv-card-meta">
      <span class="tv-card-stats">
        <span>♥ <%= post.likes_count %></span>
        <span>💬 <%= post.comments_count %></span>
        <span>👁 <%= post.views_count %></span>
      </span>
      <span class="tv-arrow" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none"><path d="M2 8h11M9 3.5 13.5 8 9 12.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
      </span>
    </div>
  </div>
<% end %>
